			"notes": "> [!WARNING]\n> **Pre-Alpha Testing Release**: This build targets Minecraft 26.3 Fabric. It is in active development and provided for in-game testing. Back up your worlds before testing.\n\n### Key Highlights & In-World Fixes in Alpha 4:\n\n• **Reforged Item Tooltips & Deduplication**:\n  - Fixed duplicate attribute tooltips (\"When equipped:\", \"When in Main Hand:\", and \"When held:\") on reforged weapons and tools by enforcing 1:1 slot group mapping.\n  - Restored affix item names (prefix/suffix combinations like *Violent Diamond Sword of the Berserker*) in item tooltips.\n  - Restored dynamic rarity colors on item names matching the loot rarity (Uncommon, Rare, Epic, Mythic, Ancient).\n• **Socket Indicators & Tooltip Image**:\n  - Implemented `SocketTooltipComponent` in common code and wired `ItemStack.getTooltipImage()` to `SocketTooltipRenderer` via Fabric's `ClientTooltipComponentCallback.EVENT`.\n  - Sockets and socketed gems now render properly in item tooltips.\n• **Jade & JEI Compatibility**:\n  - Fixed Jade HUD info for the **Apothic Enchanting Table** (now properly displays Eterna, Quanta, Arcana, and Clues like the vanilla and Raven tables).\n  - Registered the Apothic Enchanting Table as a valid Infusion Crafting Station and added ingredient documentation in JEI.\n• **Apothic Tome Towers & Chest Loot**:\n  - Fixed empty chest loot at the top of Tome Towers by adding `FRONTIER` tier fallback for initial `HAVEN` tier generation, and guarded `GemLootPoolEntry` against NPEs on null gem rolls.\n  - Fixed empty item frames on tower walls so they now consistently generate with visible tiered gems.\n  - Added origin / nearest-player fallback in `GenContext.forLoot` to prevent loot generation failures when chests generate or open without a direct player entity context.\n• **World Tier Tutorial Soft-Lock**:\n  - Fixed next/skip button soft-lock on `WorldTierTutorialScreen`, allowing clean exit on the final slide, skip button click, `Escape`, or `E`.\n  - Keybind conflict resolved with `Ctrl + T` default toggle for World Tier screen.\n• **Models & Translations**:\n  - Restored block/item JSON models for `gem_case` and `ender_gem_case`.\n  - Fixed raw block item localization keys by adding `.useBlockDescriptionPrefix()` across all module blocks.\n\n### Target Environment:\n\n• **Minecraft**: `26.3`\n• **Fabric Loader**: `>=0.19.5` (tested on `0.20.1`)\n• **Fabric API**: `>=0.161.0+26.3` (tested on `0.165.0+26.3`)\n• **Java**: `25`\n• **Bundled**: YetAnotherConfigLib (`3.9.6+26.3-fabric` via JiJ)\n\n### SHA-256 Checksums:\n\n• `fabricated-apotheosis-1.0.0-alpha.4.jar`: `f87b6df01de159944e395d7edb9b0713041f5c1bb89147b5e6c9b4ab1b2de227`\n• `fabricated-apotheosis-1.0.0-alpha.4-sources.jar`: `cbcd92c769a6577a29ee95949e4cd741945a8bc73e6e4894b1cd6449b4cdf966`"
		},
