			"notes": "> [!WARNING]\n> **Pre-Alpha Testing Release**: This build loads on Minecraft 26.3 Fabric and passes resource loading and server world gen, but is **still broken and in active development**. Expect missing features, incomplete mechanics, and visual/gameplay bugs. Do NOT use in production worlds without backups.\n\n### Status: It Loads!\n- **Startup & Resources**: Fixed client crash during initial resource loading (`EnchantTableRendererMixin` and dynamic gem model dispatch).\n- **Atlases**: Fixed atlas stitching issues (`Multiple atlases used in model`).\n- **Dynamic Registries**: Captured server datapack registries during reload (all 99 affixes, 21 gems, 30 gear sets, 23 invaders, 4 elites, 9 rogue spawners, 27 tier augments, and 5 rarities now load cleanly with 0 decoding errors).\n- **Enchanting Tables**: Fixed placement crash (`Invalid block entity` for Apothic and Raven enchanting tables).\n- **Network**: Fixed packet decoder crash on custom gradient text colors (`light_blue_flash`).\n- **Creative Tabs**: Restored Apothic Adventure creative tab and potion charms with uncapped max level search.\n- **World Tier**: Fixed keybind conflict (now Ctrl+Alt+T), Haven unlocked status, and tutorial background rendering.\n\n### Target Environment:\n- **Minecraft**: `26.3`\n- **Fabric Loader**: `>=0.19.5` (tested on `0.20.1`)\n- **Fabric API**: `>=0.161.0+26.3` (tested on `0.165.0+26.3`)\n- **Java**: `25`\n- **Bundled**: YetAnotherConfigLib (`3.9.6+26.3-fabric` via JiJ)\n\n### SHA-256 Checksums:\n- `fabricated-apotheosis-1.0.0-alpha.3.jar`: `94f4841d226200fa263c288cf896f1f339e9d7a9743dc6e8399d7d68b64ddbd6`"
